This project was developed as part of the SPRIND Composite Learning Challenge
(https://www.sprind.org/en/actions/challenges/composite-learning),
funded by the German Federal Agency for Disruptive Innovation (SPRIND).

As a participant in this challenge, we provide disclosures related to pre-existing
and sideground intellectual property rights (IPR) as required by the participation
agreement (Anlage 3).

Signed IPR disclosure documents are stored in the `legal/` directory of this repository.
They are included to support SPRIND program compliance and transparency for evaluators
and authorized reviewers.
